  "description": "Life was so easy for Ma Si-woo, the eldest son of the Paseong Group, that he was simply bored out of his mind. In a life where he lacked absolutely nothing, there was only one thing entirely out of his reach... A comic book character he had fallen head over heels in love with.\n\nNo matter what he tried, his desire for the character remained unfulfilled. One night, fueled by alcohol, he made a wish on a passing shooting star: to meet the comic character he loved. And when he opened his eyes... A man looking identical to his favorite character was kicking him?!\n\nDid the shooting star actually grant Si-woo's wish?\n\nA passionate romance between Ma Si-woo, a man who could easily have anything he wanted, and Jin Do-rim, his long-awaited \"ultimate fave\"! *(Source: Lezhin, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/favoriteboy)",
